 [Tracing](/run/tracing).
 
+### Your own name and logo
+
+`EXECUTOR_PRODUCT_NAME` replaces Executor in page titles, sign-in, setup guides, MCP consent,
+OAuth resource and client metadata, and the MCP server name clients list. Setup commands name
+the MCP server after it in lowercase, such as `acme-tools` for `Acme Tools`.
+`EXECUTOR_PRODUCT_LOGO_URL` replaces the logo and favicon; serve a square image of at least 64
+pixels. With another name, setup guides leave out Executor's own plugins and screenshots, and
+the dashboard leaves out Executor's feedback and GitHub links. The built-in app keeps the name
+Executor and shows your logo.
+
